r-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u4grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u4grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 4 • LESSON 17</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Haalat-e-Nasb (Haal): مُجْرِمٌ ← مُجْرِمًا (Do Zabar) (Page 38–39)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">مُجْرِمٌ ، خَائِفٌ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Haal (ـًا)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">مُجْرِمًا ، خَائِفًا</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• مُجْرِمٌ ، خَائِفٌ (Mujrim, darne wala) se مُجْرِمًا ، خَائِفًا (Mujrim ban kar / darne ki haalat mein) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Qur'an Majeed mein yeh tarkeeb saikdon maqamaat par barah-e-raast samajh aati hai.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 38–39):** Jab kisi ism ke saath **'... ban kar / ... hote hue / ... ki haalat mein'** ka mafhoom ada karna ho (jise Arbi grammar mein *Haal* kehte hain), toh us lafz ke aakhir mein **Do Zabar (`ـًا`)** aur Alif lagaya jata hai: `مُجْرِمٌ ← مُجْرِمًا` (mujrim ban kar), `خَائِفٌ ← خَائِفًا` (darte hue), `قَاعِدًا أَوْ قَائِمًا` (baithe hue ya khade hote hue)."}},{"id":"sec_s4l17_lbl1","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Section 1 (Page 38): مُجْرِمٌ ← مُجْرِمًا (Do Zabar / Haal) Alfaaz"}},{"id":"sec_s4l17_pairs","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":1,"arabic":"مُجْرِمٌ","hinglish":"Mujrim","translations":{"en":"A criminal","ur":"مجرم","hi":"मुजरिम"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">مُجْرِمٌ</span>","displayOrder":1},{"id":2,"arabic":"مُجْرِمًا","hinglish":"Mujrim ban kar bahaiseeyat mujrim","translations":{"en":"As a criminal","ur":"مجرم بن کر / بحیثیت مجرم","hi":"मुजरिम बन कर / बतौर मुजरिम"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">مُجْرِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">مًا</span>","displayOrder":2},{"id":25,"arabic":"يَتِيمٌ","hinglish":"Yateem","translations":{"en":"An orphan","ur":"یتیم","hi":"यतीम"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">يَتِيمٌ</span>","displayOrder":3},{"id":26,"arabic":"يَتِيمًا","hinglish":"Yateem ban kar","translations":{"en":"As an orphan","ur":"یتیم ہو کر","hi":"यतीम होकर"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">يَتِي</span><span class=\"nonroot\">مًا</span>","displayOrder":4},{"id":3,"arabic":"رَحْمَةٌ","hinglish":"Rahmat","translations":{"en":"A mercy","ur":"رحمت","hi":"रहमत"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">رَحْمَةٌ</span>","displayOrder":5},{"id":4,"arabic":"رَحْمَةً","hinglish":"Rahmat ban kar","translations":{"en":"As a mercy","ur":"رحمت بن کر","hi"