"id":"sec_s4l17_g2","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s4l17_g2_w1","arabic":"خَالِدًا فِيهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">خَالِدًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِيهَا</span>","hinglish":"Us mein hamesha rehne wala ban kar","translations":{"en":"Abiding eternally therein","ur":"اس میں ہمیشہ رہنے والا ہو کر","hi":"उसमें हमेशा रहने वाला होकर"}},{"id":"s4l17_g2_w2","arabic":"شَاهِدًا وَمُبَشِّرًا وَنَذِيرًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">شَاهِدًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">مُبَشِّرًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">نَذِيرًا</span>","hinglish":"Gawah ban kar aur khushkhabri dene wala ban kar aur darane wala ban kar","translations":{"en":"As a witness and a bearer of glad tidings and a warner","ur":"گواہ بن کر اور خوشخبری دینے والا اور ڈرانے والا بن کر","hi":"गवाह बन कर और ख़ुशख़बरी देने वाला और डराने वाला बन कर"}},{"id":"s4l17_g2_w3","arabic":"فِي الْمَدِينَةِ خَائِفًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فِي الْمَدِينَةِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">خَائِفًا</span>","hinglish":"Shehar mein darne wala ban kar","translations":{"en":"In the city, fearful","ur":"شہر میں ڈرتے ہوئے","hi":"शहर में डरते हुए"},"ref":"28:18"},{"id":"s4l17_g2_w4","arabic":"مِنْهَا خَائِفًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">مِنْهَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">خَائِفًا</span>","hinglish":"Us se darne wala ban kar","translations":{"en":"From it, fearful","ur":"اس سے خوف زدہ ہو کر (ڈرتے ہوئے)","hi":"उससे डरते हुए"}},{"id":"s4l17_g2_w5","arabic":"لَهَا بَشَرًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">لَهَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">بَشَرًا</span>","hinglish":"Uske liye insaan ban kar","translations":{"en":"Before her as a human","ur":"اس کے لیے انسان بن کر","hi":"उसके लिए इंसान बन कर"}},{"id":"s4l17_g2_w6","arabic":"وَمُبَشِّرًا بِرَسُولٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">مُبَشِّرًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بِرَسُولٍ</span>","hinglish":"Aur ek Rasool ke zariye khushkhabri dene wala ban kar","translations":{"en":"And bringing good tidings of a messenger","ur":"اور ایک رسول کی خوشخبری دینے والا بن کر","hi":"और एक रसूल की ख़ुशख़बरी देने वाला बन कर"}},{"id":"s4l17_g2_w7","arabic":"مُصَدِّقًا بِكَلِمَةٍ مِنَ اللهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مُصَدِّقًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بِكَلِمَةٍ مِنَ اللهِ</span>","hinglish":"Allah ki taraf se ek kalma ki tasdeeq karne wala ban kar","translations":{"en":"Confirming a word from Allah","ur":"اللہ کے ایک کلمے کی تصدیق کرنے والا بن کر","hi":"अल्लाह के एक कलिमे की तस्दीक़ करने वाला बन कर"},"ref":"3:39"},{"id":"s4l17_g2_w8","arabic":"قَاعِدًا أَوْ قَائِمًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">قَاعِدًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَوْ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">قَائِمًا</span>","hinglish":"Baitha hote hue ya khada hote hue","translations":{"en":"Sitting or standing","ur":"بیٹھے ہوئے یا کھڑے ہو کر","hi":"बैठे हुए या खड़े होकर"},"ref":"10:12"},{"id":"s4l17_g2_w9","arabic":"لَحْمَ أَخِيهِ مَيْتًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">لَحْمَ أَخِيهِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">مَيْتًا</span>","hinglish":"Apne bhai ka gosht murda hote hue","translations":{"en":"The flesh of his brother while dead","ur":"اپنے بھائی کا گوشت مردہ حالت میں","hi":"अपने भाई का गोश्त मुरदा हालत में"},"ref":"49:12"},{"id":"s4l17_g2_w10","arabic":"شَاهِدًا وَمُبَشِّرًا وَنَذِيرًا وَدَاعِيًا إِلَى اللهِ بِإِذْنِهِ وَسِرَاجًا مُنِيرًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">شَاهِدًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">مُبَشِّرًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">نَذِيرًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">دَاعِيًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلَى اللهِ بِإِذْنِهِ وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">سِرَاجًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُنِيرًا</span>","hinglish":"Gawah ban kar aur khushkhabri dene wala ban kar aur darane wala ban kar aur Allah ki taraf uske hukm se bulane wala ban kar aur roshan charagh ban kar","translations":{"en":"As a witness and a bearer of glad tidings and a warner, and one who invites to Allah by His permission, and an illuminating lamp","ur":"گواہ بن کر اور خوشخبری دینے والا اور ڈرانے والا بن کر اور اللہ کے حکم سے اس کی طرف بلانے والا اور روشن چراغ بن کر","hi":"गवाह बन कर और ख़ुशख़बरी देने वाला और डराने वाला बन कर और अल्लाह के हुक्म से उसकी तरफ़ बुलाने वाला और रोशन चिराग़ बन कर"},"full_width":true,"ref":"33:45-46"}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s4l17_lbl3","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Section 3 (Page 39): Mukammal Qur'ani Jumle (Numbered 1–4)"}},{"id":"sec_s4l17_s1","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s4l17_s1_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"هُوَ الْحَقُّ مُصَدِّقًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">هُوَ الْحَقُّ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">مُصَدِّقًا</span>","hinglish":"Woh tasdeeq karne wala ban kar haq hai","translations":{"en":"It is the truth, confirming","ur":"وہ سچ (حق) ہے تصدیق کرتا ہوا","hi":"वह हक़ (सत्य) है तस्दीक़ करता हुआ"},"ref":"35:31"},{"id":"s4l17_s1_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"وَهَذَا بَعْلِي شَيْخًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَهَذَا بَعْلِي </span><span class=\"nonroot\">شَيْخًا</span>","hinglish":"Aur yeh mera shohar boodha hote hue hai","translations":{"en":"And this my husband is an old man","ur":"اور یہ میرا شوہر بوڑھا ہے","hi":"और यह मेरा शौहर बूढ़ा है"},"ref":"11:72"},{"id":"s4l17_s1_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"وَهَذَا صِرَاطُ رَبِّكَ مُسْتَقِيمًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَهَذَا صِرَاطُ رَبِّكَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">مُسْتَقِيمًا</span>","hinglish":"Aur yeh aapke Rabb ka raasta seedha hote hue hai","translations":{"en":"And this is the path of your Lord, leading straight","ur":"اور یہ آپ کے رب کا سیدھا راستہ ہے","hi":"और यह आपके रब का सीधा रास्ता है"},"ref":"6:126"},{"id":"s4l17_s1_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"هُوَ قَانِتٌ آنَاءَ اللَّيْلِ سَاجِدًا وَقَائِمًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">هُوَ قَانِتٌ آنَاءَ اللَّيْلِ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">سَاجِدًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">قَائِمًا</span>","hinglish":"Woh raat ki ghadiyon mein sajda karne wala aur khada hote hue farmabardar hai","translations":{"en":"He is devoutly obedient during periods of the night, prostrating and standing","ur":"وہ رات کی گھڑیوں میں سجدہ کرتے ہوئے اور کھڑے ہو کر عبادت گزار ہے","hi":"वह रात की घड़ियों में सजदा करते हुए और खड़े होकर इबादतगुज़ार है"},"ref":"39:9"}]}}]}}